OL,3,GNEWSACitizens Advice to house new
OL,4,Aveterans support centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is funding 14 new
OL,7,Fcentres to support veterans and their
OL,8,Ffamilies as they adjust to civilian
OL,9,Flife.
OL,11,FAmong the sites chosen was Citizens
OL,12,FAdvice Rushmoor in Aldershot, the town
OL,13,Fthat boasts it is the home of the
OL,14,FBritish Army.
OL,16,FThe aim is for it to be a single front
OL,17,Fdoor for those seeking help with
OL,18,Fservices including housing, debt
OL,19,Fcounselling and even how to navigate
OL,20,Fthe NHS.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
