OL,3,GNEWSACitizens Advice to house new
OL,4,Aveterans support centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe centre was visited ahead of the
OL,7,Fannouncement by veterans' minister
OL,8,FCalvin Bailey, who said its selection,
OL,9,Fas the first of a second wave of Valour
OL,10,FHubs, showed "the importance of this
OL,11,Fcommunity to our nation".
